		'<strong>Exchange Guidelines:</strong><ul><li>Securely package the item you are returning for exchange to prevent damage during transit. Use the original packaging if possible.</li><li>Use a reliable shipping service to send the package back to us. We recommend a service that provides tracking information. This helps ensure the package reaches us safely and allows you to track its status.</li><li>After shipping your exchange package, please notify us by replying to the initial email or contacting our support team with the tracking number.</li><li>Upon receiving the exchanged items, we will inspect them to ensure they meet our exchange policy criteria. If the items are in good condition and meet the criteria, we will process the exchange.</li><li>Once the exchange is approved, we will ship the replacement item to you. You will receive a confirmation email with tracking information once the new item is dispatched.</li><li>Exchanges will be processed within 5-7 business days of receiving the returned items. The shipping time for the new item may vary depending on your location.</li></ul>' => '<strong>Retningslinjer for ombytning:</strong><ul><li>Pak den vare, du returnerer til ombytning, sikkert for at forhindre beskadigelse under transporten. Brug den originale emballage, hvis det er muligt.</li><li>Brug en pålidelig forsendelsesservice til at sende pakken tilbage til os. Vi anbefaler en tjeneste, der giver sporingsoplysninger. Dette hjælper med at sikre, at pakken når os sikkert og giver dig mulighed for at spore dens status.</li><li>Når du har sendt din byttepakke, bedes du give os besked ved at besvare den første e-mail eller kontakte vores supportteam med sporingsnummeret.</li><li>Når vi har modtaget de ombyttede varer, vil vi inspicere dem for at sikre, at de opfylder vores byttepolitikkriterier. Hvis varerne er i god stand og opfylder kriterierne, behandler vi ombytningen.</li><li>Når byttet er godkendt, sender vi erstatningsvaren til dig. Du modtager en bekræ